      "id": 1,
      "text": "Huson began as a Northern Pacific Railroad station around 1894, named after construction engineer H., anchoring the town’s early identity.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        5,
        8,
        9,
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/huson"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Gold struck Nine Mile Gulch in 1874, drawing miners and sparking the founding of Huson and nearby settlements.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/huson"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The post office opened as Glaude in 1897, honoring hotelier Napoleon Glaude, before adopting the name Huson a year later.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        12,
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Web source 2",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/huson"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A Forest Service Ranger Station in Huson earned a spot on the National Register of Historic Places, alongside the nearby Nine Mile Community Center.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/huson"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Perched at 3,015 feet, Huson sits in the flat Clark Fork River valley, surrounded by gently rising hills of the intermontane basin.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25,
        29,
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Huson%2C_Montana"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The Northern Pacific line linked Huson to Missoula, enabling local businesses to ship logs, minerals, and farm goods to larger markets.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
